    <title>S3E2｜日本咖啡文化：从古老茶馆到时尚咖啡店</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a2d6e0b56ceb45ea64661b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a2d6e0b56ceb45ea64661b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期明信片带你深入探索东京咖啡文化，从传统沏茶店到现代咖啡馆的演变，再到精品咖啡的创新与多样化。分享东京本地不容错过的精品咖啡店。探讨日本在口味、风格和消费习惯上与中国的不同，以及日本咖啡未来趋势。打开明信片，来享受一杯咖啡吧。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><ul><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a>:日本早期咖啡店</span></li><span> </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">00:04:10</a>:日本与国内的咖啡文化差异：品味与偏好的对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">00:06:12</a>:东京咖啡店探秘：独特风味与咖啡文化的邂逅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">00:08:15</a>:四家口碑超好的咖啡店推荐！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">00:10:16</a>:口味独特、注重自由的咖啡品牌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">00:12:19</a>:网红咖啡店祛魅：口碑爆棚却口味一</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">00:14:20</a>:从东京闻到了全球咖啡趋势风潮：除科技管理，透明溯源以外，还有:)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Tokyo Coffee Shop:</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Side Walk Stand Coffee</span></strong><span>  東京都目黒区青葉台1-23-14</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>VERVE COFFEE ROASTERS</span></strong><span>  東京都港区六本木5-16-7</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>STREAMER COFFEE COMPANY</span></strong><span>  東京都渋谷区渋谷1丁目20-28</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Ogawa Coffee Laboratory</span></strong><span>  東京都世田谷区北沢3-19-20 reload1-1</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><br></p>]]></description>
